# The workspace-wide excludesfile (projects/gitignore) has a bare `core`
# pattern for core dumps; it also matches the tracked source directories
# here. Negate exactly those paths (a leading `/` in a negation anchors it
# to this .gitignore's directory).
!/src/core/
!/test/core/
